  "historyNote": "#6702, eff 3-3-98, EXPIRED: 3-3-06 New. #8785, eff 1-3-07, EXPIRED: 1-3-15 New. #11172, INTERIM, eff 8-29-16, EXPIRED: 2-25-17 New. #12212, eff 6-16-17",
