  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1501.06 Licensee",
  "priorExpiration": "2017-02-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1501.06 \"Licensee\" means a holder of a driver license that has been under suspension or revocation, a holder of a commercial driver license that has been under disqualification, or a person whose registration has been under suspension or revocation.\n\nSource. #6702, eff 3-3-98, EXPIRED: 3-3-06\n\nNew. #8785, eff 1-3-07, EXPIRED: 1-3-15\n\nNew. #11172, INTERIM, eff 8-29-16, EXPIRED: 2-25-17\n\nNew. #12212, eff 6-16-17",
